msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"I can tell you're not just some guy off the street. You got some real fire "
"in your eyes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"You're a real player, aren't you? Well, I got a great place I'd like to "
"show you. Follow me if you're interested."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "Sorry, but I think I'll pass."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"Oh, that's too bad. Still, you know where to find me if you change your "
"mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "Back again, sonny? Interested in that great place I told you about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Yeah, lead the way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "You won't regret this. Follow me. It's right through this door."
msgstr ""

